---
description: RestaurantOS project rules (multi-tenant restaurant SaaS)
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md`, then `docs/PROGRESS.md` ("Next action") before starting work.
- Follow ADRs in `docs/adr/`. Money is decimal; tax/rounding only through `BillCalculator`/`Money`.
- Tenant isolation via `ITenantScoped` + query filters; outlet routes require the outlet access filter
  and an explicit `Permission`. Cross-tenant access returns 404.
- Financial/stock writes are transactional + idempotent; stock ledger is append-only.
- Audit sensitive actions. Use mock adapters for third-party integrations without credentials.
- External inputs (API keys, provider webhooks) are verified in fixed time and deduplicated by
  provider event/external id before any order or payment effect (ADR-0006).
- Verify with `dotnet test`, frontend `npm run lint && npm run build`, and Playwright for UI flows.
  Record real results in `docs/PROGRESS.md`; never claim unverified success.
- No secrets, no real customer data, no proprietary vendor code/branding, no deployments without approval.
